# Project configuration is loaded only from configs/default.yaml.
# Never put Kaggle credentials in a project .env file, even when Git ignores it.
# Use official user-level ~/.kaggle/access_token or ~/.kaggle/kaggle.json,
# browser login, or set KAGGLE_API_TOKEN in your terminal environment.
# Legacy environment names: KAGGLE_USERNAME and KAGGLE_KEY.
# Optional KAGGLE_CONFIG_DIR must point outside the project repository.
# See docs/DATASETS.md. Do not paste credentials into chat.
